# Check out every text file with LF, whatever core.autocrlf says.
#
# The committed files are LF, but Git for Windows defaults to autocrlf=true,
# which rewrote all of them to CRLF on clone. The smoke test
# test_no_python_source_uses_crlf then failed on every fresh Windows checkout,
# and a CRLF shell-invoked script is a real runtime failure on POSIX.
* text=auto eol=lf
